  "Rival Kazuo|Step three: go to the small chart and wait for price to do something new right at the level \u2014 a candle that closes past the last little high or low. Then, and only then, you enter on the close . Big chart. 15-minute. Small chart. In that order, every time.": "0a34a3ae9d4d73da.mp3",
