  "Sensei Hoshi|Behold the legendary shield: the STOP-LOSS . When you open a trade, you set a line: 'If the price hits HERE, close my trade automatically.' It cuts a losing trade while the loss is still tiny.": "924448c7f9bbd8a1.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|But not every gap deserves your attention. We only use a gap for an entry if the move that made it did something NEW \u2014 it took out a swing point : a hill or valley that had never been touched before .": "bf1f090ec024d257.mp3",
