  "Sensei Hoshi|Demon one: FOMO \u2014 the Fear Of Missing Out. The price rockets up, your heart screams 'JUMP IN NOW!' ... usually right before it falls back down. The patient ninja waits for the next proper setup.": "8115e4c655fa75c1.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|E \u2014 Execution (The setups). Only trade Dad's two setups (the BNRs ): \u2460 Bounce & Reject (his favorite) at the outer highs/lows of a range \u2014 never the middle. \u2461 Break & Retest . Play the second move , not the first! Price always comes back for you.": "ee131439ade95b87.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|Every craft has its own language, and trading is no different. Learn these words now and no chart, video or trader will ever sound like a puzzle again.": "abfdc46981f14de7.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|HH = Higher High: a hill taller than the last hill. HL = Higher Low: a valley that did not fall as far as the last valley.": "b6c3bacf0de99241.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|Here is the powerful part. In an uptrend, the last Higher Low is the step holding everything up. As long as price stays above it, the staircase is alive. Buyers are still in charge.": "796ad35b10a9bbef.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|Here is the secret of the clock: each session hands off to the next . New York sets up Asia. Asia sets up London. London and Asia together set up the next New York. So every session, we look at the chart fresh.": "01af50da00bde4da.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|Imagine you tell your friend: 'Next Friday, I promise to trade you my dragon card for 10 Koins \u2014 no matter what!' That promise itself becomes valuable. If the dragon card becomes super popular by Thursday, your friend's promise to get it for only 10 Koins is a treasure!": "a93cf732e8e8520c.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|In our dojo's chart, each candle is a few minutes of the trading day. Watch them form, one by one, and you will feel the market's rhythm. Quiz time, then your first dojo mission awaits!": "cc3f61439fb94cff.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|In this dojo you will tame two legendary beasts. First: NQ \u2014 the Nasdaq-100 futures , the Lightning Stallion. It follows 100 giant tech companies and charges FAST \u2014 prices near 21,500 , leaping dozens of points in minutes!": "03e58a118ad7bad2.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|Listen closely to such videos and you find the hidden truths: the same trader lost 2,000 gold three days earlier . His bot was broken for a week. It traded twice when it planned ten. Social media shows the highlight reel \u2014 never the report card.": "475a76a602352d10.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|Listen closely, for this is the most important arc of your entire training . Every anime hero needs armor. A trader's armor is called risk management .": "f5556a15613ec7e3.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|Long means you buy first , hoping price goes up. Short means you sell first , hoping price goes down. In futures both are completely normal.": "7e353c570aa751cd.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|NQ and Gold do not sleep when you do. Futures trade almost all day and all night , from Sunday evening to Friday afternoon. But the market is not the same animal at every hour.": "b6eb4d02d44b8f77.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|Now the big rule of this whole academy: take entries AT your levels, and take targets FROM your levels. Never trade in the empty middle between two lines. The middle is where beginners get chopped up.": "5d5d9d480aa31c5b.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|Now the deepest wisdom: sample size . Flip a coin three times and get three heads \u2014 is the coin magic? Of course not! One green day proves NOTHING. A real strategy is judged over many, many trades \u2014 like a season, not one match.": "8c7dd555dc0b8afd.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|Now the rule that matters most: a pattern only counts at a level . A hammer in the middle of nowhere is just a candle. A hammer sitting right on a floor you marked earlier? That is the market talking.": "6c47c9795fe3b6f7.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|Now the secret that binds them: CONFLUENCE . One clue is a rumor. Two clues is a hint. Three clues pointing the same way is a plan! Big chart + Level + Closed candle , all agreeing \u2014 that is when a strategist strikes.": "b3faf87380bd32be.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|Now, the special scroll of this dojo: the futures contract . It is a promise to buy or sell something at a set price on a future day.": "dbcca22bf7dac083.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|On wild days, the wise trader adapts: trade smaller, keep the shield closer to your heart, and be pickier about which battles to fight. Wild markets give bigger chances \u2014 and bigger dangers.": "da2d298ad37962ee.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|One final scroll, and it may protect you more than all the others combined. There is a demon that lives inside phones. I call it... the Hype Demon .": "1fd110173203a75d.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|One final secret map, young sage. Liquidity means how many orders are waiting to trade at each price. Some prices are quiet ponds... others are deep treasure pools full of resting orders.": "e4244edb0b5eb9b9.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|One more gap counts: the last gap made before price started to pull back . Those two kinds \u2014 and no others. Mark them on the big charts, the 4-hour and 1-hour , then let the 15-minute and a smaller chart guide you in.": "64b399557c4e2aa2.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|One more shape, built from three candles: the swing point . A swing high is a candle whose high is taller than the candle before AND after it. A swing low is the opposite. These are the hills and valleys we mark.": "7af7ec565850d246.mp3",
