  "|Price broke above yesterday's high, later came back down to it, and bounced up off it. What did that old ceiling become?": "3af89347f5596aec.mp3",
  "|Price climbed all the way to yesterday's highest point \u2014 and stopped dead, twice. Why there ?": "7e76a40fa5bf6908.mp3",
  "|Price comes in to fill the gap and takes out any stop sitting inside it.": "14d8c901e1d4832b.mp3",
  "|Price continued against us. Without the stop the loss would have kept growing. And the context: the hourly direction was down \u2014 this trade was against the higher timeframe.": "3591750ed98e1f3a.mp3",
  "|Price dipped below yesterday's lowest point and snapped straight back up above it. Which way is the more likely trade now?": "64e06ed5bbc6e0a6.mp3",
  "|Price dropped to your support line. What is the LAST candle called?": "cf0fb82798ba04b4.mp3",
  "|Price fakes one way right before a session starts. What does a patient trader expect?": "f056e681ae8de02a.mp3",
  "|Price fell back into the empty step, reached halfway, and then this happened. Is that unusual?": "3e89a5ed4498ac68.mp3",
  "|Price goes 10 points your way on ONE Micro NQ contract. What did you make?": "b5ff3c7c8e814965.mp3",
  "|Price has dropped to this line twice and bounced both times. The line is acting as\u2026": "333f088b4f7ab85e.mp3",
