  "|Start on the big chart. Each candle here is one HOUR. The hour has been heading down. Remember that \u2014 because the trade we are about to watch goes the OTHER way.": "4ca324962aca6501.mp3",
  "|Start on the big chart. Each candle here is one HOUR. The hour has been heading up \u2014 so today we only want trades going up.": "f1907cf3b29491fc.mp3",
  "|Start on the higher timeframe. Each candle is one hour. The hourly direction is down \u2014 note that, because the trade we are about to watch goes against it.": "1021b569ad25a3e8.mp3",
