  "|Start with the prior day. PDH is the previous day's high and PDL is the previous day's low. Every participant can see these two prices.": "8578d7d66bd91569.mp3",
  "|Stop just beyond the level. A close past it = idea invalid. No moving it, no hoping.": "7f52986405bc52d6.mp3",
