  "|Stopped out: \u221241.50 points, $83 per Micro contract. That is the plan working \u2014 a small loss, sized in advance.": "3047b42b4e7131ae.mp3",
  "|Straight through means the buyers who were supposed to be waiting there weren't there. When the reason for your idea disappears, so does the idea.": "f082eadd1844a293.mp3",
  "|Straight up the mountain. Every step higher than the last.": "1bae86db4bb1c700.mp3",
  "|Stuck between two gas stations is a range. The method stands aside.": "9f3a23d242058519.mp3",
  "|Support is a floor: falling stops there and price bounces.": "91bb2dbf4357eae2.mp3",
  "|Support is a price where a decline stops and turns up. Resistance is a price where a rise stops and turns down. Almost every tool on a chart ends up acting as one of the two.": "1bf3ba50ecb83eed.mp3",
  "|Support is the floor \u2014 prices often bounce up from it. Resistance is the ceiling.": "bb8c5e01c4d3f776.mp3",
