  "|That is the flip: broken resistance often turns into support.": "e4af5ff01f810664.mp3",
  "|That is the police chase \u2014 running from your own stop. It turns a small loss into a big one.": "ed07c2b27c03a5e0.mp3",
  "|That is trading against the line before price has shown you anything. Wait for the close.": "8394d7029c2cdf28.mp3",
  "|That last one lost Koins even though you chose correctly. What should you do next time you see a climbing market?": "390bcbff797b2635.mp3",
  "|That trades against the level with no evidence. Wait for the close.": "36f756338dcb30af.mp3",
  "|That's FOMO \u2014 Fear Of Missing Out. The patient ninja waits for the next proper setup.": "db0f1205eb7c1f0c.mp3",
  "|That's an uptrend: even the pullbacks are getting higher. The floor keeps rising.": "9d43f49658400e19.mp3",
  "|That's it \u2014 you've finished the ground floor. Everything from here is just this checklist with better names: watch the level, wait for the close, take the trade only when the clues agree, wear the shield. Go and hunt.": "fa1607b23b0a0be5.mp3",
  "|That's it. Higher steps. A climbing market still has red candles in it \u2014 it just keeps making higher ground.": "82eb29a37ef5e34b.mp3",
  "|That's the empty step. The middle candle jumped the whole distance in one go, so that price band got skipped.": "056b6071b82af0db.mp3",
  "|That's the normal shape: dip in, refuel, carry on. It's why traders wait at halfway instead of chasing price down.": "c9c278455ec30efd.mp3",
  "|That's the real reason. Calm-you protects panicking-you. Write the number down before the bell.": "50bc6c39c2553fca.mp3",
  "|That's the trading plan \u2014 your sacred scroll.": "8a11aef670f4afa3.mp3",
  "|That's the whole art. You can't control whether a trade wins. You CAN control what it costs you when it doesn't.": "0ccf3a81bd19db33.mp3",
  "|That's the whole idea. A percent is a SLICE, so it grows when the pile grows.": "54d46423f4f31c3b.mp3",
  "|That's the whole reason to learn any of this: it lets you decide in advance , while you're calm, instead of deciding in a panic while price is moving.": "0307d173a1177291.mp3",
  "|The 15-minute has to agree with the big chart. Until it does, there is nothing to do but wait.": "3633eb8080116713.mp3",
  "|The best traders spend most of their day...": "52e1b1ef63143cee.mp3",
  "|The bigger the pile, the bigger 10% of it is. True or not?": "c78797faac60f564.mp3",
  "|The body shows where price opened and closed. The wicks are the thin lines.": "c21d440d4d117691.mp3",
  "|The box breaks upward, but yesterday's high is right overhead blocking the way. The clues disagree. What do you do?": "f781d522eab4842d.mp3",
  "|The candle closed, so NOW we act. We buy right where it closed: 25,173.50.": "3f893526a2438f31.mp3",
  "|The candle closed, so NOW we act. We buy right where it closed: 29,605.25.": "4aea91a51d5e0688.mp3",
